<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" class="scroll-smooth">
<%- include('partials/head') %>

<body class="grid min-h-screen place-items-center bg-slate-50 px-6 font-sans text-slate-600 antialiased dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400">

    <main class="relative isolate w-full max-w-xl overflow-hidden py-16 text-center">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 blur-3xl dark:bg-rose-600/20" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="relative">
            <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3" aria-label="PhyChi, retour a l'accueil">
                <span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 via-brand-600 to-flask-600 shadow-glow">
                    <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
                        <path d="M20.2 20.2c2.04-2.03.02-7.36-4.5-11.9-4.54-4.52-9.87-6.54-11.9-4.5-2.04 2.03-.02 7.36 4.5 11.9 4.54 4.52 9.87 6.54 11.9 4.5Z"/>
                        <path d="M15.7 15.7c4.52-4.54 6.54-9.87 4.5-11.9-2.03-2.04-7.36-.02-11.9 4.5-4.52 4.54-6.54 9.87-4.5 11.9 2.03 2.04 7.36.02 11.9-4.5Z"/>
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
                    Phy<span class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Chi</span>
                </span>
            </a>

            <span class="mt-12 inline-grid h-16 w-16 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 dark:bg-rose-500/10 dark:text-rose-400" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="h-8 w-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg>
            </span>

            <h1 class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
                Service momentanement indisponible
            </h1>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                Une erreur est survenue de notre cote. L'incident a ete enregistre&nbsp;; merci de reessayer dans quelques instants.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
                <button type="button" onclick="window.location.reload()" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-brand-600 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-glow transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-brand-700 sm:w-auto">
                    Reessayer
                </button>
                <a href="/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50 sm:w-auto dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-slate-800">
                    Retour a l'accueil
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
